383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1038 0 R
/ActualText (Application for Refugee Status: Asylum seekers apply for refugee status at the Refugee Status Determination \(RSD\) office in Dzaleka, where they are given an interview date.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1039 0 R
/ActualText (Review and Decision: A committee comprising representatives from immigration, police, Ministry of Homeland Security, and other bodies reviews applications. Accepted applicants receive refugee status, while denied applicants may appeal to the Minister of Homeland Security. If the appeal is rejected, they become "People Not of Concern.")
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
