/ActualText <>
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Despite facing threats to abandon his pursuit of justice, Fideli remained determined to hold the perpetrators accountable. Tragically, he succumbed to his injuries four months later. To date, there has been no formal investigation or arrests, allowing the suspects to evade justice.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
