/ActualText <>
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Finally, during the forced re-encampment period, reports were filed with Inua of government staff )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (charging students who wanted to return to their secondary schools and universities, between K5,000 and K40,000 for a certification letter. Other re-encamped families were charged up to K40,000 for a tent in the communal shelter area, and others still alleged paying up to K300,000 to obtain a vacant lot for housing, or to build a shop for resuming business. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
