/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Refugee management involves a diverse range of stakeholders, all working together to support refugees and ensure a harmonious environment between them and their hosts. Central to these efforts is the Government of Malawi, specifically the Ministry of Homeland Security, which holds the primary responsibility for overseeing and coordinating refugee affairs in the country. )
/E (Refugee management involves a diverse range of stakeholders, all working together to support refugees and ensure a harmonious environment between them and their hosts. Central to these efforts is the Government of Malawi, specifically the Ministry of Homeland Security, which holds the primary responsibility for overseeing and coordinating refugee affairs in the country. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
