605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (As the leading global agency for refugee protection, UNHCR plays a pivotal role in ensuring that refugees in Malawi are safeguarded and have access to their fundamental rights, including the right to life, freedom from torture, and protection against discrimination. UNHCR provides essential humanitarian aid through its implementing partners, offering critical support such as food, shelter, healthcare, and education. The agency also focuses on enhancing refugees' self-reliance through various empowerment programmes.)
/E (As the leading global agency for refugee protection, UNHCR plays a pivotal role in ensuring that refugees in Malawi are safeguarded and have access to their fundamental rights, including the right to life, freedom from torture, and protection against discrimination. UNHCR provides essential humanitarian aid through its implementing partners, offering critical support such as food, shelter, healthcare, and education. The agency also focuses on enhancing refugees' self-reliance through various empowerment programmes.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
