/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The camp is divided into several zones, some named after Malawian citys and neighbourhoods: Blantyre, Zomba, Karonga, Dzaleka Hills, Katubvya, New Katubvya, Kawale 1, and Kawale 2. In addition to the community leaders, each zone has its own leaders who represent the diverse mix of nationalities within their areas. Zone leaders play a key role in maintaining order, facilitating communication, and advocating for the rights and well-being of their communities. This structure ensures support for all residents, irrespective of nationality.)
/E (The camp is divided into several zones, some named after Malawian citys and neighbourhoods: Blantyre, Zomba, Karonga, Dzaleka Hills, Katubvya, New Katubvya, Kawale 1, and Kawale 2. In addition to the community leaders, each zone has its own leaders who represent the diverse mix of nationalities within their areas. Zone leaders play a key role in maintaining order, facilitating communication, and advocating for the rights and well-being of their communities. This structure ensures support for all residents, irrespective of nationality.)
