/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In recent years there has been a noticeable decline in funding, largely due to donor fatigue. This fatigue stems from various factors, including the growing number of global conflicts, the protracted nature of the refugee situation in Malawi, and restrictive laws that hinder refugees from achieving self-reliance.)
/E (In recent years there has been a noticeable decline in funding, largely due to donor fatigue. This fatigue stems from various factors, including the growing number of global conflicts, the protracted nature of the refugee situation in Malawi, and restrictive laws that hinder refugees from achieving self-reliance.)
