/ActualText (Remy Gakwaya was a self-taught computer programmer who began teaching the skill to others in the camp, with increasing reach and success, through his organisation TakenoLAB. A few years ago Remy founded Relon Malawi \(the network of all refugee-led organisations in Malawi\).)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
