699 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Despite restrictive laws, refugees have significantly impacted Malawi's entrepreneurship and food security sectors. They have transformed local commerce by establishing shops known for extended opening hours, reliability, and affordability.  In agriculture, their partnership with Malawian landowners in Dowa District has revolutionized tomato farming and boosted the value of soya and groundnuts, creating sustainable, long-term work for thousands of Malawians.)
/E (Despite restrictive laws, refugees have significantly impacted Malawi's entrepreneurship and food security sectors. They have transformed local commerce by establishing shops known for extended opening hours, reliability, and affordability.  In agriculture, their partnership with Malawian landowners in Dowa District has revolutionized tomato farming and boosted the value of soya and groundnuts, creating sustainable, long-term work for thousands of Malawians.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
